<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id" />
  <para style="h">2 Peetelo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Muhanda a myole wa Peetelo</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Peetelo</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Pe</para>
  <para style="mt2">Muhanda a myole wa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Peetelo</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili</para>
  <para style="ip">Muhanda a myole wa Peetelo mo wunuuwu, huli baa Mukristo boosi baasonehele. Peetelo li mu uleele ti lipfu la nde lika bebele <char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 1:13">1.13</ref></char>. Nde li mu usonehe muhanda mo wunuuwu mana baa Mukristo bayibwala moonyi mu ndongisili a nde.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muhanda li mu uvondo bo mu <char style="em">ukeelese mimbutu mi imiinu hya bo</char> na<char style="em">ukangama mu mandongisili </char> ma bo baayaki (buli la <char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 1">1</ref></char>). Humbisa, muhanda mo wunuuwu li mu ulwanisa ba bali mu ulongese mi mapfuta, banga a mbiili ya yayuhu (buli la <char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 2">2</ref></char>). Titswene, muhanda mo wunuuwu li mu uyambila mu ilumbu hi Pfumu Yisu hu uyafutaha (buli li <char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 3">3</ref></char>). Bamukristo ba tungi la hati a tsomi, baakwidi boosi hwavele umono nziili a Yisu. Musamu mo wunuuwu anyingisi imiinu hya baatu ba banzuhisini, bu Yisu avelelenge ayafutaha. Ka bu baa Mukristo bali mu ukeele nziili a nde, <char style="em">Nzambi li mu umweese mukami a nde</char>. Nde li mu uva taangu huli baatu, mana bo basobo mbiili.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu uhwadisa imiinu hya bo, baa Mukristo bali na mabuuku ma mimbihuli mya Nzuhisini li Likulu. Bo bali kaka na ndongisili yi baayaki huli bambangi baa Yisu Kristo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 3:2">3.2</ref></char>). Tangu yi baasonehe muhanda mo wunuuwu, mihanda mya Pahuli, myayabana (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 3:15">3.15</ref></char>). Tso litondi utsikaha na usaangula Mabasonehe (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 1:20">1.20</ref></char>), a likuhasa lo siha ve, na huveletsima (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 3:16">3.16</ref></char>). Likumbasa la baa Mukristo bakima na li Livupu la Ngidi, lili taangu yoosi na kaluha.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Ni me Simoni Peetelo, musalili na iluumbi hya Yisu Kristo. Me ndi mu utsonehele huli benu, baa lili na imiinu hya tsongo we hya bisu mu hyese hya Yisu Kristo, Nzambi na Muyobili a bisu. <verse eid="2PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Nyaha Nzambi asyeme benu na ava benu hyenze hi hyafulala mu nzaabili a Nzambi na Yisu Pfumu a bisu.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaluha a teelili a Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Nzambi mu matwala ma nde, ava bisu byosi bi byakuha mu idiingu hya bisu, mu ukangama mu nde. Pfumu ayabisi bisu wuuna wu ateele bisu, mu muyusu na bubwe bwa nde. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Ni mu buuna, Nzambi amiisa bisu manzuhisini ma bungodu bwa talu na bu bubwe. Nde hasiidi manzuhisini mo maana, mana benu limata mu manzala ma uvanga mambu ma mabi ma utsala baatu ba tsi. Ŋa mbuha unyambana, Nzambi miikitusa benu bababwe, we nde mwakulu wuli wu mubwe.<verse eid="2PE 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Ni mu buuna, benu lafwana uva mifudi mya benu myosi, mu ubwese ŋa yulu imiinu hya benu, mbiili yimbwe; na ŋa yulu a mbiili yimbwe, nzaabili a Nzambi; <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />ŋa yulu a nzaabili a Nzambi, ukuta hu linyutu; ŋa yulu ukuta hu linyutu, mukonono; ŋa yulu mukonono, ukangama hwa mu Nzambi; <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />ŋa yulu a ukangama hwa benu mu Nzambi, litondo li bumwana bu bungu bwa mu Kristo; ŋa yulu litondo li bumwana bu bungu bwa mu Kristo, bwesaani litondo. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Eye, tso benu lili na bisiha mo biina, na tso byo bipfuni mu benu, byo byutelemese benu mu usala. Na nzaabili a Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo sa yibutala benu mimbutu. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Ka muutu wu avele na byo, li we muutu nga monihili yi kusi, na nde li inzimana. Nde amiivusana ti Nzambi atsyemisi nde mu masumu ma nde matsomi.<verse eid="2PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Ni mu buuna, baana ba ngu, hwadaani mu usa mifudi mu usilasa ti ni mbuli, Nzambi ateele benu na asoolo benu mu uba buli la nde. Tso benu livaangi buuna, benu utwala ubwisa imiinu hya benu ve. <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />Ka ni buuna Nzambi husiingasa benu kotili mu Ipfumu hi bilima na bilima, hya Pfumu na Muyobili a bisu Yisu Kristo.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukangama mu ndongisili yi mbwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Ni mu tooni mo yiina, me apfwana ubaayibwala benu moonyi mu bisiha mo biina. Ka me nzaabi ti benu laamikwayaba byo, na benu laamiikangama mu imbuli hi benu laayaki. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Ka me ndi mu utsima ti, hwafwana huli me mu ubaayibusa benu mu uba likanda, bu me kini moonyi. <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />Ka, me nzaabi ti taangu yi lipfu la me yaka bebele, we bu Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo hayabisi me. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Ka me tsa kwada mu uyelese benu, mana humbisa lipfu la me, benu libaayibwala moonyi mu ma me ndi mu undongese benu.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Ŋa bisu laayabisa benu nziili a Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo hutso matwala ma nde moosi, bisu a laasingama mu masahu ma baatu baasuunda mu buyedi bwa bo ve. Ka bisu laamono bunene bwa nde mu miisu ma bisu. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Mu tooni ati, Taata Nzambi ava nde likiinzu na muyusu, ŋa ndaha a nde yi yapali hutso mayidu ma muyusu yaleeli: «Wunuwu ni Mwana a me wu litondo, wu li mu usa kinya a me yoosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:1-5">Mty 17.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-7">Mlk 9.2-7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-35">Luk 9.28-35</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Ndaha mo yiina yamati hu yulu. Bisu mwakulu layuhi yo, ŋa bisu laaba na nde hu yulu isyelo hya ngidi.<verse eid="2PE 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Ni mu buuna, bisu lili mu usa hiitu hya bisu hyoosi mu mambu ma mimbihuli. Hwafwana huli benu mu ukele mambu ma mimbihuli mo miina. Mu tooni ati, mambu mo maana mali we mwinda wu li mu umwedeme ŋa mbuha ya pipidi. Hwadaani mu ukeele mo natee ŋa busi bu ukya, natee ŋa mvwelele a ŋa ngwali hupanduha hutso mitima mya benu. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Yaabaani hati a tsomi ti, a huli na pasi dyaambu li mimbihuli myasonehe mutso mabuuku ma Ngidi, li muutu hu ubindula mu matsimi ma nde mwakulu ve. <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />Ka, a mu litondo li imuutu baabihuli ve. Ka ni mu likumbasa li Livupu la Ngidi, baatu baatoyi mu nduhi a Nzambi.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Ŋa hati la buli li Isereli, hwaba na mimbihuli mi mapfuta. Bumosi kaka, ŋa hati la benu sa huba na milongisi mi mapfuta. Milongisi mo miina sa mikotese na dyeele loosi, ndongisili yi ubita baatu hu udunga. Bo sa batuna Pfumu wu ayobolo bo. Nzambi sa abungasana bo ipakali. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Baatu ba banzuhisini bu uduukala bo hutso a mbiili a bo yimbi. Na mu tooni a bo, baatu bu utuha nzila yi imbuli. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Mu tooni linyungi la mbongo, bo sa basoho benu mu bitoyili bya bo bi mapfuta. Ka tsundusu a bo, umata beleve, yamiitswiha. Na ndungili yili mu ukete bo.<verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Mu tooni ati, Nzambi asyembi bapofi ba baabwidi mu masumu, nde abwahi bo hutso a «mbeenge yi yadongo». Ni huuna bali mu ukeelese bo hutso a piipidi, bahada mu mapanga, natee ilumbu hya nde hya tsundusu. <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />Nzambi asyembi kaka baatu ba taangu a tsikulu, ŋa nde hatsindihi nyamba ŋa yulu a baatu banga masumu. Ka nde afuuhisi Nowa, wu aba mumosi mu pwombo la ba baafuuhi, bu nde hakalongese nzila yi yafwana. <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />Bumosi kaka, Nzambi atsundisi misyenge mya Sodoomo na Ngomooro, mu iteesi hya mbaahu, na nde akitusi myo mufutu. Ni mu umweese ifwaani hya ma mu uyiila huli banga masumu boosi. <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />Ka nde afuuhisi Loti, wu akadyata hutso butsiitsa. Loti aba mu lingebe mu tooni a mbiili a baatu ba taangu a nde, ba baakavele buyumu, ba baakaveledukala mikele mya Nzambi. <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />Mu tooni ati muutu mo wuuna, nga butsitu, wu aba ŋa hati la bo pasi ilumbu, akamono pasi hutso mutima, mu ma nde hakamono na ma nde hakayuha. <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Ni mu buuna, Pfumu yaabi buni nde hu uyobolo mu malobese ba baakangama mu nde. Nde yaabi buni nde hukeelese baa bubaavaanga ma mabi mu usyembe bo, mu ilumbu hya tsundusu. <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />Nde usyembe homo, ba bali mu udyata mutso mapeyu ma bo ma musunya, na ba bali mu upenye lituma la Pfumu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Milongisi mi mapfuta mo miina, myaluula mu nyeme na mu isaayi. Bo bali mu urokolo tso bisiha bya hu yulu, bi byaluula mu muyusu, hwavele umono boomo. <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />Tso bapofi ba baafulala bo mifudi na matwala, a bali mu uyehele utuha bisiha bya hu yulu ŋa busu bwa Pfumu ve. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Ka milongisi mo mi mapfuta minimi, myafwana na bibulu bi byavele na buyedi. Bo bali we bibulu bi Nzambi havanga mu ukangama mu myeto, mana baduba byo. Milongisi mi mapfuta minimi, mili mu utuha bi bo baaveleyaba. Bo buukwa we bu bibulu bibaakwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />Wuuna ni musyendo a mavaanga ma bo ma mabi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:13">Bo bali na kinya mu ukuhasa mapeyu ma bo ma mabi ngembele a nyangu. Bo bali ndulu toodi na ipiha. Bo bali na kinya mu usalila mapfuta, hutso mikungi mi bo bali mu uba itwadi na benu. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Miisu ma bo maluula mu peyu usa mayamba na bo babaakwilala mu usa masumu. Mu myeto mya bo, bo bali mu uduta babavele na imiinu hi hyabama. Mitima mya bo myaluula mu nzala a mbongo. Tsingili a Nzambi yaaka mu bo. <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Bu bo baasiisi nzila yi yasungama, bo baadungi, na baaduukili nzila a Balaami, mwaana a Bosoli<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:2-35">Mat 22.2-35</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 31:16">31.16</ref></char></note>. Nde wu atondi mbongo yi baaviidi nde mu usa bubi. <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />Ka Nzambi asyembi nde bu nde havelisiingala mukele. Buuna, ibulu hi hyavele a ndaha, hyayambili na nde we bu baatu bubaayambila, na hyasukisi nzila budyabidi yi mumbihuli Balaami hakaduukala.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Milongisi mi mapfuta mo miina, mili we mitswe mi manzali mi myavele a mamba, we mayidu ma ifula hili mu utsindahala. Nzambi amikwavangila bo mbuha hutso a pipidi ya dunga-dunga. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Bo bali mu usa bileedi bi binene bi byavele lisuunga. Humbisa mapeyu ma bo ma mayamba, bo bali mu usoho ba bamiikingula buyedi mawasa ma, na bamiisiisa manzila ma budyabidi. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Milongisi mi mapfuta mo minimi, mili mu usa nzuhisini huli baatu mo baana ti bo sa baba bunyanga bwosi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bunyanga bwosi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ni utondo uleele ti milongisi mi mapfuta mili mu ulongese ti, baatu abasaali hu tsina mikele mya Nzambi ve.</char></note>. Ka bo mwakulu bali baviha baa mapeyu ma mali mu ubita hu lipfu. Mu tooni ati, pasi muutu li muviha a hi hili mu utuma idiingu hya nde. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Mu mbuli, hu li na baatu ba baamiinyaha uvanga mambu ma mabi mamali mu utuma tsi. Mu tooni ati, bo baayabi bubwe-bubwe Pfumu na Mufuhisi a bisu Yisu Kristo. Ka tso babwekulamana hu tsina lituma li mavaanga ma mwakulu, idiingu hya bo hya tsyelele sa ifulala pasi na hyatsomi. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Hubeedi bubwe huli bo ŋa tsomi, mu uveleyaba nzila yi lisunga. Ka a mu uyaba yo, na ubwetehele mikele mya ngidi mbisa ve. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Ma mamiyila bo, ni ma makuma mali mu uleele: «Mvwa ubafutahala udya bi nde amiimana uluha<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 26:11">Mak 26.11</ref></char></note>!» Buuve: «Ngulu wu miimana uyobo mamba, ubabweya uyobo murobo!»<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Pfumu li mu uya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Bambaahi baa litondo, wunuwu ka ni muhanda wa myole wu me ndi mu utsonehele benu. Hutso mihanda mi myole, me ndi mu unzibwala benu ndongisili yi benu laayaki, mu usaha uyelese nzaabili a benu yi misamu. <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />Yibwalaani moonyi, mu mambu ma mimbihuli mya ngidi myayabisi umata beleve. Yibwalaani kaka mukele wu Pfumu na Muyobili hatoosili benu, mu nzila biluumbi bya nde.<verse eid="2PE 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Hati a tsomi, yaabaani ti mu bilumbu bya tsyelele, sa umonehele bakwedi. Bo sa baduukala mapeyu ma bo ma mabi na ubaakwede benu. <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />Bo sa baleele: «Yisu asiidi nzuhisini ti nde uyafutaha. Ka nde a hayafutaha ve! Umata bu bakaaha ba bisu baakwidi, byosi byamiikwilala we hu mbandili a toto.» <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Baatu mobaniba bakondini uyaba ti: umata beleve, Nzambi avangi yulu na toto mu lituma la mambu ma nde. Nde apalisi toto mu mamba, na ni mu mamba nde havangi yo. <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />Bo badimbili kaka ti, Nzambi anyambisini toto mu taangu a tsikulu mu mamba ma nyamba. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Mu ma mali mu utala toto na mayulu ma loloyi, mambu ma nde mali ti, Nzambi amiikeelese byo, mana nde anyengese byo hu mbaahu, mu ilumbu hya tsundusu, hi boosi ba baavelekiinza nde bu ukwa.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Ka dyaambu limosi li benu lu uvelevusana, bambaahi baa litondo ni ti: huli Pfumu, ilumbu imosi hili we iveeve (1 000) hi bilima, na «iveeve (1 000) hi bilima hili we ilumbu imosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 90:4">Mkg 90.4</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Pfumu a hutaamba mu utswihasa manzuhisini ma nde, we bu baatu bakima bali mu utsima ve. Ka nde li na mukami mu tooni a benu. Nde a hatondi ti tso mumosi mu benu anyambana ve. Ka nde tondi ti baatu boosi basobo mbiili na usa imiinu hya bo mu nde. <verse eid="2PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Ka ilumbu hya Pfumu hyuya kidumana we ŋa mwibi ubaya. Mu ilumbu mo hiina, yulu lu udimbala na idumu hiinene. Bisiha bya hu yulu byunyenge hu mbaahu na byukuda. Buuna, toto yoosi na mavaanga ma baatu moosi sa biyabaana paayalala mu tsundusu.<verse eid="2PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Mu tooni ati bisiha byosi sa bidimbala, yaabaani buni benu lafwana mu udyata! Mbiili a benu yafwana uba ya ngidi na yi Nzambi hatondo. <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />Benu laafwana ukeele na uhwada, mana ilumbu mo hiina, ilumbu hya Nzambi, hiveletamba mu uya. Ilumbu mo hiina, bya hu mayulu byusulamana hutso a ludi la mbaahu. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Ka bisu lili mu ukeele nzuhisini li Nzambi hasa: yulu li linyatihi na toto yi nyatihi, hu butsiitsa bwa Nzambi bumonehele.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Ni mu buuna, bambaahi baa litondo, bu lili mu ukeele ilumbu mo hiina, hwadaani mu uba babaatsyeme. Baani babaavele masyembo ŋa busu bwa Nzambi, mu hyenze hi nde ali mu uva. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Benu laafwana mu uyaba ti mukami a Pfumu a bisu, ni liyobolo la benu. Ni buuna kaka mwaana a ngu a bisu wu litondo, Pahuli haleeli ŋa nde hasonihi mu tsiki yi Nzambi hava nde. <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />Ni buuna nde hasonehe mambu mo maana mu mihanda mya nde myosi. Hu li na mambuha mu mihanda mya Pahuli ma mali na pasi mu utsikaha. Baatu bakima babaavele na nzaabili, na ba bali velo-velo, bali mu usobo mbindulili a mambu mo maana. Bo bali mu ubindula we bu hu li matsimi ma bo ma upfuta. Bumosi kaka, bo bali mu ukalula mbindulili a mambu mu mambuha makima ma Libuuku la Nzambi. Tsalili mo yiina yili mu ubita bo hu ubungana.<verse eid="2PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Ka benu bambaahi baa litondo, bu me miinzibusa benu, baani likanda. Kebaani baatu ba bavelekiinza Nzambi, ba baamiidunga nzila yimbwe, a balobese benu. Mana benu a lipatusa kwadili a benu mu Yisu Kristo. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Ka nyaha benu likula hutso a hyenze na nzaabili a Yisu Kristo, Pfumu na Muyobili a bisu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 3:18">Nyaha muyusu aba huli nde, loloyi na mu bilima na bilima! Ameni!<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>